abstract: >-
  Python implementation of the mathematical core of the manuscript "The Shadow Price of Credit:
  An Explainable-AI Decision-Support System for Corporate Recapitalization under Credit-Line
  Withdrawal": cash and debt identities, minimum-equity linear program, credit-to-equity
  substitution index (CES/ISC), directional shadow price of credit capacity, infeasibility
  diagnosis and the automated consistency tests of Section 9, Appendix A and the directional form.
